	<Folder id="5F9866E5F9000001">
		<ex:extension>base64;GgA</ex:extension>
		<name>Labeled Gradient Path</name>
		<visibility>0</visibility>
		<description>3D flight track. BLUE = measured Arduino GPS ascent. ORANGE = measured Arduino GPS descent. GOLD = modeled parts connecting sparse measured SPOT fixes and correcting near-ground GPS altitude. GREEN DOTS = SPOT measured horizontal position (shifted -20s based on dual-device cross-check). GPS gaps are explicitly tagged and the path between spots is modeled, not directly observed. SPOT reported altitudes were unreliable aloft and are never used as true height. KML times are shown in placemark descriptions (UTC); this file deliberately omits TimeStamp and gx:Track for compatibility. The 3D geometry uses meters above sea level.</description>
		<styleUrl>#__managed_style_24D00B75CD42DAA43A6B</styleUrl>
